: "005.png", "id": "1039875214854716", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393516_1039875218188049_231288402583328065_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=506_CvfLrDoQ7kNvwGnOqH9&_nc_oc=AdojPblpfQKOBTJ2r51oRkjHPemasghbeSIt0ylui1TF0XoWztcV26SHL5aB43oR7FE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af930li1kG2zf3FVVnQh3Gs3Ts7hymRyKNR8p6no-YaWtQ&oe=6A295967"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "005.png", "id": "517509354762187", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391952_517509358095520_2919512691968294005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-ZkvPj1VQu4Q7kNvwF_s9Y4&_nc_oc=AdoQRp0nomSUl7y1V-MN73YnvvltaZpRs88-qCklYjgGwbOJN8sXYw95-XLvSZa3ekA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9N_-eSd0-LmtoQvYU_ig81Ju_YEH_ZUysGU_RLOcBUhQ&oe=6A297489"}, "display_name": "Legends BMX", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Legends BMX VR** brings BMX action to Mixed Reality on Meta Quest. Overlay 3D bikeparks onto your real-world environment using passthrough and ride freely within your space.\n\n- Resize the track to fit your room.  \n- Link up insane tricks and climb the global rankings.  \n- Join weekly challenges and compete on *online leaderboards*.\n\n**Actively developed, but already solid and fun**  \nWhile we're actively improving and expanding the game, this VR version already offers a complete and stable experience. *Legends BMX* is also being developed for PC and consoles, where it's being very well received.\n\nJump into the park and help us fine-tune the final experience.  \nThanks for being part of the journey \u2014 see you in the park!\n", "short_description": "Pure flow and adrenaline \u2014 now in Mixed Reality!\nRide your BMX through dynamic parks superimposed on your real-world space. Pull off insane tricks, chase high scores, and feel the thrill of BMX in a whole new way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "develope